Hi.

I will give the entire document a more thorough read, but I wanted to =
comment on section 1.2 earlier. Its title is =E2=80=9CMajor differences =
from TLS 1.2=E2=80=9D, but the content is a change-log. The kind of =
change-log that usually gets deleted by the RFC editor.

I hope we don=E2=80=99t plan to publish with sentences like =E2=80=9CAllow=
 cookies to be longer=E2=80=9D.  OTOH I think it will be useful to have =
an actual =E2=80=9Cmajor differences from TLS 1.2=E2=80=9D section, but =
AFAICT it=E2=80=99s not yet written.

Yoav

